<title>BAHRAIN: SOCCER-UAE BEAT BAHRAIN 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UAE BEAT BAHRAIN 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BAHRAIN 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The United Arab Emirates beat</p>
<p>Bahrain 2-1 (halftime 1-0) in their World Cup Asia zone group</p>
<p>three qualifier in Manama on Friday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Bahrain - Hamid Darwish 89</p>
<p>UAE - Adel Mohammed 20, 62</p>
<p>    Standings     Pl   W   D   L   F   A   Pts</p>
<p> UAE		   2   1   1   0   2   1    4</p>
<p> Jordan		1   0   1   0   0   0    1</p>
<p> Bahrain	     1   0   0   1   1   2    0</p>
<p>Next match: April 14 - Bahrain v Jordan.</p>
</text>
